The math library of hxmc's programs (LibM.hx, LibMTrig.hx, LibMArc.hx in this
directory) translates code of these projects, under the MIT License:

- exp, log, pow and their tables: Arm's Optimized Routines
  (https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines, math/), licensed
  "MIT OR Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception"; used here under the MIT License.
- sin, cos, tan, asin, acos, atan, atan2 and their tables: the CORE-MATH
  project (https://core-math.gitlabpages.inria.fr/, src/binary64/).
- fmod, scalbn and fma's integer algorithm: musl (https://musl.libc.org/).

